$MDESC::Type = "Combat for Flags";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Combat for Flags" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Zeta Hercules XI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Morning" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other for control of Zeta Hercules XI, a cold, inhospitable world, even by Starwolf standards.  Each team must capture the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base.  The first team with 10 captures shall be the victor!"@
		 "\n\nThis Mission has been design to run within the TRIBAL COMBAT system. Anti-TK TRAITOR code has been enabled. "@
		 "Anyone who Team Kills shall be switched to TEAM TRAITOR.";

